@startuml
title CampusFind System - Claim Submission & Verification Activity Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #1F4E79
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0284C7
skinparam DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam DiamondBorderColor #D97706

start

:Browse Public Item Catalog;
:Select Target Found Item;
:Open Ownership Claim Form;

repeat
  :Enter Name, Contact, & Secret Clue Details;
  :Submit Claim to RecoveryService;
  backward:Display Validation Error Alert;
repeat while (Are required fields present and valid?) is (No - Incomplete)
->Yes - Valid;

:System Assigns Claim ID & Status "PENDING";
:Save Claim Record to File Storage;
:Claim Appears in Admin Verification Queue;

|Campus Administrator / Reviewer|
:Open Claim Review Interface;
:Select Pending Claim;
:System Displays Founder's Private Clue\nSide-by-Side with Claimant's Proof;
:Examine and Compare Identifying Details;

if (Does Claimant Proof Match Founder's Private Clue?) then (Yes - Verified Match)
  :Enter Approval Remarks;
  :Mark Claim as "ACCEPTED";
  :Update Item Status to "RESOLVED";
  :Auto-Reject Competing Claims for this Item;
  :Save Changes to File Storage;
  :Item Authorized for Campus Handover;
  stop
else (No - Mismatch / Suspicious)
  :Enter Rejection Reason;
  :Mark Claim as "REJECTED";
  :Save Changes to File Storage;
  :Item Remains "OPEN" for Genuine Claimant;
  stop
endif

@enduml
